Dialogue: 4,0:00:02.41,0:00:05.25,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Today, nationwide, is Mother's Day.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:05.86,0:00:08.23,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Regardless of whether or not you like your mother...
Dialogue: 4,0:00:08.35,0:00:10.84,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Regardless of whether or not your relationship with her is good...
Dialogue: 4,0:00:11.31,0:00:16.17,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,If you're a Japanese citizen, you'll take this matter seriously.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:18.11,0:00:22.39,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I didn't come to this park with a solid reason.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:22.73,0:00:25.84,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Only purely, randomly, aimlessly...
Dialogue: 4,0:00:25.84,0:00:28.44,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,riding on my mountain bike.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:28.98,0:00:31.13,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Riding and riding until I reached this park.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:31.78,0:00:35.77,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,But for me to be the only one in the park even though it's a Sunday...
Dialogue: 4,0:00:35.77,0:00:39.41,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It's as if I'm the only one in the entire world, isn't it?
Dialogue: 4,0:00:40.88,0:00:43.50,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,This may be a bit of an exaggeration,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:43.50,0:00:47.74,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,but it feels as if I have the rights to the entire park.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:48.69,0:00:51.30,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Like I never need to go back home anymore.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:51.30,0:00:53.16,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,That's how I feel right now.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:54.27,0:00:54.95,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Only me.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:56.45,0:00:57.66,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I'm all alone.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:09.41,0:01:11.26,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Alone again, huh?
Dialogue: 4,0:01:11.26,0:01:12.67,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,This comes as no surprise.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:13.26,0:01:14.63,Default,Karen,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 4,0:01:14.63,0:01:16.53,Default,Karen,0,0,0,,Koyomi, that's why...!
Dialogue: 4,0:03:04.33,0:03:06.42,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,My, my. What do we have here?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:06.42,0:03:08.44,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I thought the carcass of some dog had been left here...
Dialogue: 4,0:03:09.06,0:03:10.98,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,But what's this? It's Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:13.41,0:03:15.41,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,What? It was just a greeting.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:15.94,0:03:16.74,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,It was only a joke.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:17.09,0:03:18.77,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Ah, i-it's nothing.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:18.77,0:03:24.42,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Or perhaps the innocent Araragi-kun was fascinated by my charming clothes...
Dialogue: 4,0:03:24.46,0:03:26.51,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,and felt a moment of bliss.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:27.21,0:03:28.59,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Let's not worry about that pun.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:29.14,0:03:30.84,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I am indeed fascinated.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:31.29,0:03:34.93,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,But you know, "fascination" is a pretty amazing word, isn't it?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:35.23,0:03:36.01,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Did you know...?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:36.39,0:03:38.22,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,It's written with a "grass" radical on top of "hot water."
Dialogue: 4,0:03:39.09,0:03:40.38,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,In my heart,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:40.38,0:03:43.52,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,it's a level above the word "moe," which is written with a "grass" radical on top of "bright."
Dialogue: 4,0:03:43.92,0:03:48.06,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,People are expecting it to carry onto the next generation.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:48.09,0:03:48.80,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,{\an8}Note: The Kanji read "Next World" which is a pun for "Maid"
Dialogue: 4,0:03:48.53,0:03:52.78,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Like "maid fascination" or "cat ears fascination."
Dialogue: 4,0:03:53.16,0:03:54.88,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,They'll be going and saying things like that.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:57.31,0:03:58.34,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,The impression that these clothes give off
Dialogue: 4,0:03:58.34,0:04:01.37,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,is quite different from the ones I've seen you in before, so I was surprised.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:01.37,0:04:02.60,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:02.60,0:04:04.39,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:04.39,0:04:07.08,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,That's because I chose to wear more docile clothing at that time.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:07.57,0:04:08.44,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Oh, is that it?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:10.13,0:04:14.18,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Even so, I bought this set of clothing, top and bottom, yesterday.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:15.17,0:04:16.62,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I must say, I'm content.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:16.62,0:04:20.01,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,If possible, I wanted you to see it first.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:22.71,0:04:27.67,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,That you wanted to show it to me first... How do I put it...?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:27.67,0:04:29.23,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm beyond lucky...
Dialogue: 4,0:04:29.23,0:04:30.61,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I feel honored.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:30.61,0:04:33.19,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I didn't want to {\i1}show{\i0\fscx160} {\r}them to you, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:33.73,0:04:34.91,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I wanted you to {\i1}see{\i0\fscx140} {\r}them.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:35.35,0:04:38.69,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,The nuance in those statements is entirely different.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:41.94,0:04:43.58,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,By the way, Araragi-kun...
Dialogue: 4,0:04:43.58,0:04:46.27,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,What are you doing here alone?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:46.27,0:04:48.68,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Well, I was just riding around a bit.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:48.68,0:04:50.68,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I was riding my bike randomly,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:50.68,0:04:52.21,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,and there was a park,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:52.21,0:04:54.51,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,so I decided to stop and rest a bit.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:54.51,0:04:55.86,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:55.86,0:04:57.26,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Do you come around here often?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:57.63,0:05:00.67,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,This area used to be my turf.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:00.67,0:05:02.14,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Your turf...?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:02.14,0:05:05.50,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You mean you used to live around here?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:05.50,0:05:06.98,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Yeah, you could say that.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:08.67,0:05:10.56,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,But it has changed completely.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:11.22,0:05:15.12,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I'm not going to get sentimental over it,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:15.67,0:05:19.59,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,but the place where I used to live changing is...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:19.59,0:05:22.03,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,It feels like it just cuts off my motivation, for some reason.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:23.51,0:05:24.91,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Isn't that inevitable?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:26.40,0:05:28.71,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You're right. It is inevitable. {Mr. Anderson.}
Dialogue: 4,0:05:30.67,0:05:33.71,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Hey, Araragi-kun, do you mind if I sit beside you?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:34.60,0:05:35.17,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Beside me?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:35.60,0:05:37.26,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,There's something I want to talk to you about.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:38.65,0:05:39.72,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:39.72,0:05:44.97,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I was starting to feel bad, keeping the entire bench to myself.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:44.97,0:05:45.95,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:45.95,0:05:47.06,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Then I shall help myself.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:53.74,0:05:55.07,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,About what happened before...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:55.50,0:05:57.87,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I wanted to thank you one more time...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:58.32,0:06:02.24,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You don't need to thank me or anything.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:02.24,0:06:05.58,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You should thank Oshino instead. I think that's more than enough.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:07.19,0:06:10.67,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Well, I have to pay Oshino-san, so it's a bit different.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:10.67,0:06:15.43,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,As for you, I wish to express my gratitude differently.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:15.43,0:06:19.11,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Well, if you are feeling grateful to me...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:19.11,0:06:20.72,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You should just stop now.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:21.72,0:06:24.30,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Otherwise it will be hard for us to get along from now on.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:25.51,0:06:26.76,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Get along?
Dialogue: 4,0:06:28.64,0:06:29.69,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:30.74,0:06:34.48,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,May I think of you as someone close to me?
Dialogue: 4,0:06:36.59,0:06:38.10,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,That... Of course.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:38.10,0:06:43.15,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,But you are the type who doesn't make many friends, right?
Dialogue: 4,0:06:43.15,0:06:45.27,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,That was true until last year.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:45.27,0:06:49.06,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Then a paradigm shift occurred during spring break.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:50.49,0:06:51.83,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 4,0:06:52.58,0:06:54.21,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I was the same until recently.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:55.21,0:06:57.96,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,More specifically, until I met you.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:58.73,0:07:00.37,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,What does she mean?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:00.37,0:07:02.01,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,And what is this weird situation?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:02.01,0:07:05.59,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It feels as if she's about to confess to me.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:06.83,0:07:08.60,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Which means, Araragi-kun...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:08.60,0:07:12.68,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Regardless of what you say, I still wish to reward you for your help.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:14.28,0:07:16.65,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,After that, we will, for the first time...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:17.18,0:07:19.73,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,become friends of equal status.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:21.85,0:07:23.20,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Friends...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:23.84,0:07:25.16,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Friends...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:25.49,0:07:29.78,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Hence, Araragi-kun, is there anything you want me to do for you?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:30.27,0:07:32.62,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I will only take one request, but it can be anything.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:32.96,0:07:34.08,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,A-Anything?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:34.59,0:07:36.55,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Really, anything is acceptable.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:36.55,0:07:39.42,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,No matter what the wish, I will grant it. However, you are limited to only one.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:39.42,0:07:41.28,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Be it "world domination," "immortality,"
Dialogue: 4,0:07:41.28,0:07:44.51,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,"defeating the Saiyans headed to Earth right now"; all is acceptable.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:44.51,0:07:47.34,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You... Do you possess powers that surpass those of the Eternal Dragon?!
Dialogue: 4,0:07:47.82,0:07:48.92,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:48.92,0:07:50.01,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Such confidence.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:50.66,0:07:55.93,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,But indeed, truthfully, I'd prefer to hear a more personal wish.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:56.50,0:07:57.32,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Because it's easier.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:57.65,0:07:59.11,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I'd assume so.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:59.73,0:08:01.59,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Really, anything you want.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:01.59,0:08:05.18,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,For example, you might want me to put a "nyu" at the end of every sentence for a week.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:05.18,0:08:08.32,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Or perhaps you will want me to go to class without wearing panties for a week.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:09.58,0:08:13.12,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Maybe you'll want me to wake you up every day for a week, wearing nothing but an apron.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:13.64,0:08:17.29,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Or you might want me to join you on an enema diet for a week.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:17.29,0:08:19.75,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You have many different preferences, don't you?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:19.75,0:08:20.92,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 4,0:08:20.92,0:08:23.76,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Do you really think that I'm at that level of maniac perversion?!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:24.35,0:08:26.34,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Even coming from you, isn't that way too rude?!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:26.67,0:08:29.33,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,No... That... I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:29.33,0:08:34.51,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I guess if you said you wanted me to do that forever, I wouldn't be able to take it...
Dialogue: 4,0:08:34.51,0:08:36.54,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,No. Wrong. That's completely wrong!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:36.54,0:08:41.18,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I'm not angry over the fact that my level of perversion has been lowered.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:41.81,0:08:42.52,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:43.68,0:08:50.10,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,As a reference, I personally recommend "waking you up every day for a week, wearing nothing but an apron."
Dialogue: 4,0:08:50.10,0:08:52.95,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I can also make breakfast for you, if you like.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:53.46,0:08:57.08,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Isn't viewing that from behind romantic for a man?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:57.52,0:08:59.67,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You know, Senjougahara...
Dialogue: 4,0:08:59.67,0:09:07.09,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Even if we make that sort of arrangement, I think us just being "friends" will be impossible.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:07.48,0:09:11.70,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Ah, if you put it that way, you have a point. You're right.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:11.70,0:09:14.39,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Then let's just say that erotic things are off-limits.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:14.78,0:09:20.46,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Besides, I figured that you wouldn't ever ask for anything erotic, anyway.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:20.46,0:09:22.56,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You have a great deal of trust in me.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:23.48,0:09:24.40,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Well, of course. You're a virgin.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:25.18,0:09:26.86,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I guess we did talk about that, didn't we?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:27.42,0:09:30.32,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Virgins aren't that greedy, so I'm more at ease.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:30.62,0:09:32.78,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Umm... Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:33.05,0:09:35.20,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You don't have any experience either, right?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:35.61,0:09:37.87,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,What are you talking about? Of course I have experience.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:38.28,0:09:39.08,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 4,0:09:39.39,0:09:41.12,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Experience with orgies.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:42.59,0:09:45.76,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Say, even if that's true...
Dialogue: 4,0:09:45.76,0:09:51.34,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,What do you get out of telling me the truth?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:52.80,0:09:55.01,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I understand. Correction:
Dialogue: 4,0:09:56.71,0:09:58.50,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I don't have any experience.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:58.50,0:09:59.06,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I'm a virgin.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:59.51,0:10:00.04,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:00.61,0:10:05.32,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Which means the only girls who would talk to hopeless virgins like you are
Dialogue: 4,0:10:05.73,0:10:09.81,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,at best, late-blooming virgins with mental health issues such as myself.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:12.47,0:10:14.24,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,The conversation seems to have gone a bit astray...
Dialogue: 4,0:10:14.24,0:10:17.67,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,But honestly, is there anything you need help with, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:17.67,0:10:19.88,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Something that you're just troubled about?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:20.24,0:10:22.19,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Troubled...?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:22.19,0:10:25.11,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I'm not a very good talker, so I can't say it very well,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:25.11,0:10:28.51,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,but my intention of wanting to help you is sincere.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:30.72,0:10:32.09,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:32.09,0:10:33.48,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,If I dare to tell you...
Dialogue: 4,0:10:33.48,0:10:35.22,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Oh, what is it?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:35.22,0:10:36.56,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Try telling me about it.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:36.56,0:10:39.39,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You'll feel better if you just talk about it. Or so they say, anyway.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:40.32,0:10:41.39,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Umm...
Dialogue: 4,0:10:42.11,0:10:44.03,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I had a fight with my little sister.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:44.41,0:10:46.99,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Seems like something I can't help with very well.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:48.58,0:10:51.35,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,But for the time being, go ahead and tell me the rest of the story.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:51.35,0:10:52.58,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,"For the time being"?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:53.96,0:10:56.89,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Which of your younger sisters did you have a fight with?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:56.89,0:11:00.21,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You have two younger sisters, after all, don't you?
Dialogue: 4,0:11:00.21,0:11:02.21,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Yeah. You knew that?
Dialogue: 4,0:11:03.05,0:11:05.17,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,If I had to pick just one, it was the elder one.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:05.35,0:11:07.30,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,But, really, it was with both of them.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:07.86,0:11:14.56,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Both of them, always, whatever they do, and wherever they are, stick firmly together.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:14.80,0:11:17.56,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,They are the Tsuganoki Middle School Fire Sisters, after all.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:17.92,0:11:19.77,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You even know their nicknames?
Dialogue: 4,0:11:20.00,0:11:21.98,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Today is Mother's Day, right?
Dialogue: 4,0:11:22.93,0:11:24.94,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, it is, isn't it?
Dialogue: 4,0:11:26.15,0:11:28.88,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Both of them are really close to our mother.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:28.88,0:11:33.17,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,My mother dotes on them like they're cats.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:33.17,0:11:33.74,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 4,0:11:33.74,0:11:35.09,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:35.09,0:11:37.22,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,As the irresponsible eldest son,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:37.22,0:11:43.04,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,now, on this day, today, Mother's Day, you have no place at home, is that it?
Dialogue: 4,0:11:43.04,0:11:44.55,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,That's basically it.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:46.01,0:11:49.41,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I tried to sneak out of the house early in the morning, but...
Dialogue: 4,0:11:49.41,0:11:53.45,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Just as I'd gotten on my mountain bike, my sister caught me.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:53.45,0:11:54.83,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,We then had a quarrel.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:54.83,0:11:55.74,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,A quarrel?
Dialogue: 4,0:11:55.74,0:12:00.11,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,My sister wanted me to celebrate Mother's Day together with my mother.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:00.11,0:12:01.20,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,But, how do I put it...?
Dialogue: 4,0:12:01.20,0:12:03.57,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You know, I just can't.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:03.57,0:12:05.72,Default,Karen,0,0,0,,Koyomi, that's why...!
Dialogue: 4,0:12:05.72,0:12:08.20,Default,Karen,0,0,0,,That's why no matter how much time passes...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:12.32,0:12:16.39,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,To sum it all up, a person like me who can't celebrate just one Mother's Day...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:16.39,0:12:21.38,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,is angry with himself over what his four-years-younger sister said to him.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:21.38,0:12:22.26,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,How do I put it...?
Dialogue: 4,0:12:22.89,0:12:28.15,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I'm angry with myself for being such a petty human being.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:28.15,0:12:30.87,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,That's a pretty complicated problem.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:30.87,0:12:33.86,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It's not complicated. It's just minor.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:33.86,0:12:36.71,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,"I'm just a really petty person," or something like that.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:36.71,0:12:42.51,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,But even so, the more I think about having to apologize to my sister, the more I don't want to go home.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:42.91,0:12:45.32,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You don't want to go home, huh?
Dialogue: 4,0:12:46.84,0:12:52.65,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I'm afraid to say that in regard to your pettiness, there's nothing I can do, even with my abilities.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:52.65,0:12:54.41,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,How about a little encouragement?
Dialogue: 4,0:12:54.41,0:13:00.22,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,It's rather obvious, but in regard to your pettiness, there's nothing I can do, even with my abilities.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:01.50,0:13:03.92,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You must be thinking that I'm a boring person...
Dialogue: 4,0:13:04.37,0:13:06.94,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Troubled over such a small thing...
Dialogue: 4,0:13:06.94,0:13:08.26,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I can't really...
Dialogue: 4,0:13:08.59,0:13:09.49,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,stand it.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:10.62,0:13:11.72,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Small.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:11.72,0:13:18.84,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It can also be said to be lame. The sort of lameness that comes from getting a fortune told by a fortune teller.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:18.84,0:13:21.69,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You can't deny that you're charming, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:21.92,0:13:22.86,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Charming?!
Dialogue: 4,0:13:22.86,0:13:25.94,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Could it be that my charm has been drawing low-luck from fortune-telling all this time?!
Dialogue: 4,0:13:26.30,0:13:27.54,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I was kidding.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:27.54,0:13:32.15,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Besides, your lameness isn't drawing low-luck from fortune-telling.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:33.33,0:13:35.32,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Are you trying to say that I'll only be able to draw terrible-luck?
Dialogue: 4,0:13:35.66,0:13:36.72,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:36.72,0:13:38.42,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,That would be most incredible.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:38.42,0:13:40.10,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Or rather, that would be quite favorable.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:40.72,0:13:42.79,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Your lameness is something like...
Dialogue: 4,0:13:45.71,0:13:51.93,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Drawing a great-fortune, but when you read it specifically, it doesn't say that anything that good will happen.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:51.93,0:13:53.18,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,That sort of lameness.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:54.04,0:13:55.09,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,That really is lame.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:55.51,0:13:59.80,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,But Araragi-kun, you look like the type to dote on your sisters.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:59.80,0:14:01.06,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Always quarreling.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:02.28,0:14:05.25,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Are they ugly sisters who'd make your eyes bleed from looking at them?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:05.25,0:14:07.27,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,They don't make my eyes bleed!
Dialogue: 4,0:14:07.53,0:14:10.48,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Or did she betray your love?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:10.83,0:14:13.57,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Could you secretly be a siscon?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:13.80,0:14:15.03,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:15.41,0:14:19.41,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Falling in love with your sister... is just a fantasy by those who don't have sisters.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:19.41,0:14:22.54,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Okay, then Araragi-kun, you aren't a siscon.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:22.54,0:14:25.00,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You won't fall in love with your sister?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:25.46,0:14:26.54,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,How could I?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:26.54,0:14:29.73,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,That's right. You seem more like a sorocon.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:29.73,0:14:30.77,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Sorocon?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:30.77,0:14:34.44,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,The short form of sororate marriage. Also known as inter-marriage inclusive of all sisters.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:34.44,0:14:39.27,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,It means marrying the older or younger sister of one's wife who passed away.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:40.79,0:14:43.92,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Why am I a sorocon?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:43.92,0:14:47.11,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,In your case, Araragi-kun, you will most likely marry the younger sister instead of the older one.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:47.11,0:14:48.94,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Basically, you'll get your wife's younger sister...
Dialogue: 4,0:14:49.19,0:14:53.57,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,to call you "Big Brother," and then you'll marry her afterward.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:53.57,0:14:56.98,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Even after getting married, you will still let her call you "Big Brother."
Dialogue: 4,0:14:56.98,0:14:59.91,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,This is what it originally meant.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:59.91,0:15:02.54,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Then I definitely killed that previous wife!
Dialogue: 4,0:15:02.75,0:15:04.88,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Well, Araragi-kun, the sorocon...
Dialogue: 4,0:15:04.88,0:15:07.12,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Please call me a siscon. I beg you!
Dialogue: 4,0:15:07.46,0:15:10.52,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Didn't you say that you won't fall in love with your sister?
Dialogue: 4,0:15:10.52,0:15:12.50,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I will also not fall in love with the sister of my wife!
Dialogue: 4,0:15:12.88,0:15:15.78,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Then will you fall in love with a lover that is not blood-related?
Dialogue: 4,0:15:15.78,0:15:16.43,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Like I said...!
Dialogue: 4,0:15:17.13,0:15:19.97,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Huh? A lover that is not blood-related?
Dialogue: 4,0:15:20.89,0:15:24.89,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,"You sure are petty." Such a small joke is enough to leave you speechless.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:25.23,0:15:26.94,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Your words are not some small joke, you know.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:27.36,0:15:29.54,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I was testing you just now.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:29.54,0:15:31.76,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Why am I being tested?
Dialogue: 4,0:15:31.76,0:15:35.15,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Wait, does that mean you're still not going at me at full force?!
Dialogue: 4,0:15:35.47,0:15:37.61,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,To use my full potential, I'd have to transform.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:38.27,0:15:39.20,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Transform?!
Dialogue: 4,0:15:39.20,0:15:40.53,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Wow, I really want to see that!
Dialogue: 4,0:15:41.75,0:15:45.37,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You make such huge reactions, but you yourself are petty.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:45.59,0:15:51.06,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,But regardless of how petty you are, I will never abandon you.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:51.06,0:15:54.05,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I will cope with you and your pettiness to the bitter end.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:54.41,0:15:56.42,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Your words are complicated.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:56.75,0:16:01.80,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,That's why, besides your pettiness, are there any other things you are troubled about?
Dialogue: 4,0:16:02.14,0:16:04.93,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,How do you plan on scolding me this time?
Dialogue: 4,0:16:05.23,0:16:07.31,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Your significance has increased. Incredible.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:07.52,0:16:09.19,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Don't praise me in such a forced way!
Dialogue: 4,0:16:09.79,0:16:11.53,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Is there really nothing else you wish for?
Dialogue: 4,0:16:11.53,0:16:13.44,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Would you like me to help you with your studies?
Dialogue: 4,0:16:13.66,0:16:15.49,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I have already given up on that.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:15.49,0:16:17.19,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It's fine as long as I'm able to graduate.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:17.62,0:16:19.20,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Then do you want me to help you with that?
Dialogue: 4,0:16:19.43,0:16:20.95,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I can live normally and graduate!
Dialogue: 4,0:16:21.45,0:16:23.08,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Then do you want to be normal?
Dialogue: 4,0:16:23.26,0:16:25.54,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Are you picking a fight with me? You are, aren't you?!
Dialogue: 4,0:16:25.79,0:16:27.12,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I guess I am.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:29.21,0:16:31.00,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Do you want a girlfriend?
Dialogue: 4,0:16:35.82,0:16:39.51,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,What happens if I say I do?
Dialogue: 4,0:16:40.67,0:16:44.05,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Then you will have a girlfriend. That's all.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:47.79,0:16:50.85,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,No, actually I don't really want a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:52.86,0:16:54.63,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 4,0:16:54.63,0:16:57.28,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Buy me some juice next time.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:57.28,0:16:59.32,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,That should settle it.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:59.93,0:17:02.37,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Is that so? That's really unselfish.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:03.16,0:17:04.83,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You're so noble.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:11.91,0:17:14.29,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,That child was also here just now.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:15.37,0:17:16.92,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Hey, Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:17.47,0:17:21.53,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,How do you read the name on the name tag of that elementary school kid's bag?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:22.95,0:17:24.34,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I don't see anything like that.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:24.56,0:17:27.93,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Oh, a normal person shouldn't be able to see it at such a distance.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:28.18,0:17:30.04,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Umm, the numbers "eight," "nine," and "shrine."
Dialogue: 4,0:17:30.04,0:17:34.79,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,The "eight" and "nine" plus "shrine" write out to be "eight nine tera."
Dialogue: 4,0:17:34.79,0:17:36.65,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Well, that's pronounced "Hachikuji."
Dialogue: 4,0:17:36.95,0:17:38.16,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Hachikuji?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:38.16,0:17:41.26,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,So her name's Hachikuji Mayoi.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:43.77,0:17:47.45,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,She doesn't look like the type that likes small kids.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:48.57,0:17:51.47,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Hey, could you wait here for a second?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:51.47,0:17:54.50,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Yes, but where are you going?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:54.87,0:17:56.71,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I'm going to go talk to the elementary school student.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:57.20,0:17:59.67,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,You shouldn't. You'll only get a scar on your heart.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:00.80,0:18:04.13,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,How can she say these spiteful things so nonchalantly...?
Dialogue: 4,0:18:05.47,0:18:06.97,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Yo. What's up?
Dialogue: 4,0:18:06.97,0:18:08.51,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Are you lost?
Dialogue: 4,0:18:13.74,0:18:17.77,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Please don't speak to me. I hate you.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:19.45,0:18:22.22,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Did something happen?
Dialogue: 4,0:18:22.22,0:18:24.99,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I'm hurt. That's all that happened.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:26.69,0:18:28.19,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I'm going to try again.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:28.19,0:18:30.80,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,What exactly are you doing? Where are you going?
Dialogue: 4,0:18:30.80,0:18:32.54,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Can't you tell with your eyes?
Dialogue: 4,0:18:38.12,0:18:39.20,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Hey, you.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:40.37,0:18:41.77,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You're lost, aren't you?
Dialogue: 4,0:18:41.77,0:18:43.47,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 4,0:18:44.36,0:18:46.55,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Let me take a look at that memo.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:47.65,0:18:48.55,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:52.88,0:18:55.43,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Did something happen?
Dialogue: 4,0:18:55.43,0:18:58.86,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I was ignored by an elementary school girl.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:00.24,0:19:02.65,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,This time definitely... I'm going!
Dialogue: 4,0:19:02.65,0:19:08.12,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I don't really know what you want to do or what you're doing...
Dialogue: 4,0:19:08.12,0:19:08.66,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Ignore me!
Dialogue: 4,0:19:16.85,0:19:18.59,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?!
Dialogue: 4,0:19:18.59,0:19:20.29,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,So you finally turn around.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:20.63,0:19:23.26,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Anyone would turn around after such a beating from behind.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:23.45,0:19:26.81,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Well, it looked like you were having some difficulties.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:26.81,0:19:28.68,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,So I was wondering if I could help you.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:28.92,0:19:33.34,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,The kind of help a person who would suddenly attack an elementary school kid's head could offer...
Dialogue: 4,0:19:33.34,0:19:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't exist in this world!
Dialogue: 4,0:19:35.18,0:19:36.56,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Absolutely impossible!
Dialogue: 4,0:19:36.86,0:19:39.24,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, okay?
Dialogue: 4,0:19:39.24,0:19:42.86,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Um, my name is Araragi Koyomi.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:42.86,0:19:44.59,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Koyomi?
Dialogue: 4,0:19:44.59,0:19:46.28,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,It sure sounds like a girl's name, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 4,0:19:47.04,0:19:49.57,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Girly, don't come near me.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:50.60,0:19:52.99,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,So what's your name?
Dialogue: 4,0:19:53.18,0:19:55.40,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,I'm Hachikuji Mayoi.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:55.40,0:19:57.83,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,I'm called Hachikuji Mayoi.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:57.83,0:20:00.96,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,This is an important name given to me by my mom and dad.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:01.28,0:20:03.97,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,In any case, stop talking to me.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:03.97,0:20:05.85,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,I hate you.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:05.85,0:20:07.28,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 4,0:20:07.28,0:20:10.27,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I won't harm you.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:10.27,0:20:15.06,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,There isn't a more harmless person than me in this town.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:17.03,0:20:19.52,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Very well, then. I'll be less alert with you.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:19.90,0:20:21.10,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,That will make things easier.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:21.48,0:20:22.56,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Then, beastly man.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:22.56,0:20:23.57,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Beastly man?!
Dialogue: 4,0:20:23.90,0:20:25.48,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Who are you calling that?!
Dialogue: 4,0:20:25.48,0:20:27.94,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,He's yelling at me! I'm so scared!
Dialogue: 4,0:20:28.17,0:20:32.70,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for yelling at you, but "beastly man" is going just a little too far.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:32.70,0:20:34.03,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Anyone would have yelled.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:35.03,0:20:37.00,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Then, how should I address you?
Dialogue: 4,0:20:37.22,0:20:39.21,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Well, a normal way of addressing me is good enough.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:39.59,0:20:41.29,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,That is Araragi-san, right?
Dialogue: 4,0:20:41.53,0:20:44.13,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Yeah, normal is good. Normal is the best.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:44.72,0:20:47.46,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,I hate you, Araragi-san.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:49.02,0:20:51.47,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Please leave immediately!
Dialogue: 4,0:20:51.47,0:20:54.13,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,No. As I was saying, you're lost, aren't you?
Dialogue: 4,0:20:54.13,0:20:57.47,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,A minuscule problem like this is hardly a problem for me.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:57.47,0:20:58.98,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Don't be so stubborn.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:58.98,0:21:00.62,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,I am not.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:00.62,0:21:01.19,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You are.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:02.07,0:21:02.77,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 4,0:21:08.86,0:21:10.08,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,This is the end!
Dialogue: 4,0:21:12.22,0:21:12.78,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 4,0:21:23.46,0:21:25.73,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,You're so stupid.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:25.73,0:21:28.55,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Did you think that an elementary school student could beat a high school student?!
Dialogue: 4,0:21:32.69,0:21:34.48,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,There was a figure of a man...
Dialogue: 4,0:21:34.48,0:21:37.74,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,who fought an elementary school kid, threw her over his back with all his might,
Dialogue: 4,0:21:37.74,0:21:41.86,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,and was boasting about his victory from the bottom of his heart, despite the fact that he was in high school.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:43.09,0:21:44.82,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Actually, that's me.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:49.20,0:21:50.11,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:53.56,0:21:55.43,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Please allow me to explain.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:56.05,0:21:57.24,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:58.24,0:22:01.36,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Well, let's just brush aside things of the past.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:01.36,0:22:03.54,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,She seems to have lost her way.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:04.18,0:22:06.89,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I was thinking that I could help her.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:08.85,0:22:10.67,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Hmm, really?
Dialogue: 4,0:22:11.85,0:22:13.70,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,No, I see.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:13.70,0:22:15.14,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I understand the circumstances.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:16.77,0:22:18.70,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Ah, right, Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:18.70,0:22:22.51,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,If you heard the address of this area, you'd roughly know where it is, right?
Dialogue: 4,0:22:23.13,0:22:26.19,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Well yes, to a certain extent.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:26.37,0:22:28.08,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Hey, Hachikuji.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:28.08,0:22:31.03,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Give this girl a look at that memo.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:32.77,0:22:37.49,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,It seems that I had a dream of being abused by an evil high school boy.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:38.38,0:22:40.27,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Having that happen in real life sounds impossible.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:40.27,0:22:41.40,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:41.40,0:22:42.70,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Impossible, huh?
Dialogue: 4,0:22:47.73,0:22:49.46,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Take it.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:50.52,0:22:53.13,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I don't feel like touching you.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:54.41,0:22:56.47,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,It's only touching the memo.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:56.73,0:22:59.59,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I also don't wish to touch the things you've touched.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:00.36,0:23:02.33,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,All right, I get it.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:02.33,0:23:04.06,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,I will read it. Is that fine with you?
Dialogue: 4,0:23:04.47,0:23:05.52,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Eh...
Dialogue: 4,0:23:06.99,0:23:08.45,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Do you know where this place is?
Dialogue: 4,0:23:08.45,0:23:10.70,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I know that place.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:10.70,0:23:12.15,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:12.15,0:23:15.09,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,I don't know the exact location.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:15.09,0:23:18.18,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,But we should be able to find it based on our senses when we get there.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:18.18,0:23:19.57,Default,Hitagi,0,0,0,,Then, let's go.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:20.75,0:23:21.87,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Let's go, Hachikuji.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:22.02,0:23:25.02,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Oh, where are we going?
Dialogue: 4,0:23:25.02,0:23:27.19,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Like I said, we are going to the location written on the memo.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:27.19,0:23:30.50,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,That girl knows the way. She will lead you there.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:30.50,0:23:31.17,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Isn't that great?
Dialogue: 4,0:23:32.06,0:23:34.88,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,Ah, she'll lead the way...?
Dialogue: 4,0:23:36.05,0:23:37.84,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Are you not lost?
Dialogue: 4,0:23:39.31,0:23:41.43,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,No, I'm lost.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:41.62,0:23:43.52,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,I'm the lost child of a snail.
Dialogue: 4,0:23:44.68,0:23:45.81,Default,Koyomi,0,0,0,,Snail?
Dialogue: 4,0:23:46.42,0:23:48.77,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,No, I...
Dialogue: 4,0:23:50.12,0:23:51.65,Default,Mayoi,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:25.66,0:25:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Karen.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:26.41,0:25:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Tsukihi.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:27.15,0:25:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the kids of the kings are considered kings, right?
Dialogue: 4,0:25:28.63,0:25:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gotten that.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:29.66,0:25:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Reading kings seem kind of fake, don't they?
Dialogue: 4,0:25:31.75,0:25:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But the thing earlier seemed more like reading to me.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:33.77,0:25:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh really?
Dialogue: 4,0:25:34.17,0:25:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of corruption, they apparently become like kings.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:36.47,0:25:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But every once in a while, aren't the kings a bit stronger?
Dialogue: 4,0:25:38.83,0:25:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So nowadays reader kings are kind of in a heartbreaking state, huh?
Dialogue: 4,0:25:41.38,0:25:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A heartbreaking state, eh?
Dialogue: 4,0:25:42.08,0:25:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Quiz time.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:43.51,0:25:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that time, right?
Dialogue: 4,0:25:44.58,0:25:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsukihi-chan and I are twins, right?
Dialogue: 4,0:25:45.93,0:25:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not twins!
Dialogue: 4,0:25:46.49,0:25:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Which of the 12 constellations is known as the twin constellation?
Dialogue: 4,0:25:48.44,0:25:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it Gemini?
Dialogue: 4,0:25:49.09,0:25:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No, actually, Pisces is also a twin constellation.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:51.15,0:25:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true!
Dialogue: 4,0:25:51.72,0:25:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true?
Dialogue: 4,0:25:52.44,0:25:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time, Mayoi Snail Part 2.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:54.28,0:25:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But it may not necessarily be a twin.
Dialogue: 4,0:25:56.05,0:25:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It could be like us.
